            "toolName": "countdown",
            "args": {
                "seconds": 10
            },
            "result": "Countdown complete! 10 seconds have passed."
        }
    }
}
```

This means we have no way to show a proper loading state when the first tool invocation is a `result`. Not sure if this behavior is intended, but if it is, I'd very much appreciate any guidance on workarounds. Thanks in advance! 🙂 

