When multiple assistant messages arrive in a single HTTP streaming response, parts from previous messages are incorrectly carried over to subsequent messages. This results in message contamination where later messages contain both their own parts and parts from earlier messages.

## Steps to Reproduce

1. Send a request that generates multiple assistant messages in the same streaming response
2. Observe that subsequent messages contain parts from previous messages

