## Reproduction Steps

1. Call `streamText` with `openai:gpt-5-nano`, enable `experimental_telemetry`, use a cached prompt ≥1024 tokens.
  > NOTE: you may have to run several times with gpt-5-nano, it seems to only sometimes cache, use gpt-5 if you want consistency
3. Observe telemetry span attributes: `gen_ai.usage.input_tokens` ≈ prompt size, `gen_ai.usage.cache_read_tokens` ≈ cached portion.
4. Note: The cached portion is already included in `input_tokens`, so billing prompt + cache hits double counts.


