### Description

the `gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize` model is impossible to call. Standard call:

```
const transcript = await transcribe({
  model: openai.transcription('gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize'),
  audio: await readFile('audio.mp3'),
});
```

gives error: `chunking_strategy is required for diarization models`

Setting chunking strategy

```
const transcript = await transcribe({
  model: openai.transcription('gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize'),
  audio: await readFile('audio.mp3'),
  providerOptions: {
        openai: {
          chunking_strategy: "auto",
        },
      };
});
```

gives response format error: `response_format 'verbose_json' is not compatible with model 'gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize-api-ev3'. Use 'json' or 'text' instead.`

Setting response format:

```
const transcript = await transcribe({
  model: openai.transcription('gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize'),
  audio: await readFile('audio.mp3'),
  providerOptions: {
        openai: {
          chunking_strategy: "auto",
          response_format: "json",
        },
      };
});
```

is ignored. 

Related to https://github.com/vercel/ai/pull/8246

Solution: providerOptions.openai.response_format should set the response format

