The` tool-result` for code_execution is included alongside the `tool-call` only for failed/errored server executed tool calls (since for the successfull execution, there is an custom-tool call invocation to the user's server leading to the message of `role: tool` and tool-result part before the `code_execution` tools's tool-result.)
