## Proposed Fix

Modify the `prepareTools` function in `@ai-sdk/amazon-bedrock` to:

### 1. Identify Anthropic System Tools

Create a set of tool IDs that should NOT go through `toolConfig`:

```javascript
const ANTHROPIC_SYSTEM_TOOLS = new Set([
  "anthropic.memory_20250818",
  "anthropic.bash_20241022",
  "anthropic.bash_20250124",
  "anthropic.computer_20241022",
  "anthropic.computer_20250124",
  "anthropic.text_editor_20241022",
  "anthropic.text_editor_20250124",
  "anthropic.text_editor_20250429",
  "anthropic.text_editor_20250728",
  "anthropic.web_fetch_20250910",
  // web_search_20250305 is already blocked
]);
```

### 2. Map Tool IDs to Anthropic Format

```javascript
const ANTHROPIC_TOOL_TYPE_MAP = {
  "anthropic.memory_20250818": { type: "memory_20250818", name: "memory" },
  "anthropic.bash_20241022": { type: "bash_20241022", name: "bash" },
  "anthropic.bash_20250124": { type: "bash_20250124", name: "bash" },
  "anthropic.computer_20241022": { type: "computer_20241022", name: "computer" },
  "anthropic.computer_20250124": { type: "computer_20250124", name: "computer" },
  "anthropic.text_editor_20241022": { type: "text_editor_20241022", name: "str_replace_editor" },
  "anthropic.text_editor_20250124": { type: "text_editor_20250124", name: "str_replace_editor" },
  "anthropic.text_editor_20250429": { type: "text_editor_20250429", name: "str_replace_based_edit_tool" },
  "anthropic.text_editor_20250728": { type: "text_editor_20250728", name: "str_replace_based_edit_tool" },
  "anthropic.web_fetch_20250910": { type: "web_fetch_20250910", name: "web_fetch" },
};
```

### 3. Pass These Tools via `additionalModelRequestFields.tools`

```javascript
// In prepareTools function
const anthropicSystemTools = [];

for (const tool of ProviderTools) {
  if (ANTHROPIC_SYSTEM_TOOLS.has(tool.id)) {
    const toolDef = ANTHROPIC_TOOL_TYPE_MAP[tool.id];
    if (toolDef) {
      anthropicSystemTools.push(toolDef);
      // Add required betas
      if (tool.id === "anthropic.memory_20250818") {
        betas.add("context-management-2025-06-27");
      }
      // ... handle other beta requirements
    }
  } else {
    // Existing logic for non-system tools
  }
}

if (anthropicSystemTools.length > 0) {
  additionalTools = {
    ...additionalTools,
    tools: anthropicSystemTools,
  };
}
```

### 4. Skip Adding System Tools to `bedrockTools[]`

Do not add Anthropic system tools to the `toolConfig.tools` array.

