### Description

Most embedding models allow configuring the output dimensionality to be something other than the default.

At the moment, the only way to configure this is through `providerOptions`, and the exact name of the option changes from provider to provider.

```
providerOptions: {
  openai: {
    dimensions: 512
  },
  google: {
    outputDimensionality: 512
  },
  bedrock: {
    dimensions: 512
  }
}
