My suggestion is to add an optional `dimensions` option. If provided and the model does not support a configurable dimensionality an error is returned.

```
const { embedding } = await embed({
  model: 'openai/text-embedding-3-small',
  value: 'sunny day at the beach',
  dimensions: 512
});
```

